From d9c401ccf0f9a434b5845dfa004fbb7fc29f964f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chuanhong Guo <gch981213@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Sep 2024 10:18:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] phy: add support for Siflower SF19A2890 USB PHY

Add a driver for the USB 2.0 PHY of the Siflower SF19A2890. Powering it
on enables its reference clock, releases its two resets and takes it
out of sleep.

Signed-off-by: Chuanhong Guo <gch981213@gmail.com>
[jt: from OpenWrt's siflower target, SF19A2890 part only; reach the
 sleep control through the system manager syscon instead of a reg of
 its own, reset names "por" and "phy", undo the resets if the sleep
 control write fails, Kconfig dependencies and help, commit message,
 MAINTAINERS entry]
Signed-off-by: Joseph Telaak <joseph@telaak.dev>
